  "title": "Disappearing Marshmallow Brownies",
  "description": "Try this marshmallow brownie recipe for decadent blondies made with chocolate chips, butterscotch chips, and mini marshmallows. They won't last long!",
  "authors": [
    "Maryl"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-06-05T20:46:26-04:00",
